OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fdry evening and mostly cloudy with
OL,7,Fsome clear intervals. The night will
OL,8,Fremain dry with some longer clear
OL,9,Fspells developing later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FIt will be another mostly
OL,12,Fcloudy and dry day with some bright or
OL,13,Fsunny spells breaking through.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,16,FLargely cloudy skies but with some
OL,17,Fbright or sunny intervals. Staying
OL,18,Fmostly dry but the odd light shower
OL,19,Fpossible. Cooler with showers on
OL,20,FWednesday and winds strengthening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
